{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "51591646692696a405981750da4b8f79556f071850d12918fee6b0b46ae36ed2", "ja": "明日に向かって！", "zh": "迈向明天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9262994f64f257389e3449386a37d3b0c6b9e81a4c7fa7757e943f8863fb22c3", "ja": "ついにイベント最終日。詩花だけではなく\n様々なアイドルのステージを知ることで、\n一回り大きく成長した昴達5人は、最後のス\nテージに飛び出していく。その背中をプロ\nデューサーと春香は共に見守るのだった。", "zh": "活动终于来到最终日。\n经历诗花以及其他许多偶像的表演之后，\n昴她们五人进一步获得成长，\n并冲上最后的舞台。\n而制作人则与春香一同在旁守望着她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "095d7426956a4b8032c45288f264776f1819daecc4a63b8a521d498160fda0fd", "ja": "（アイサマも、今日でいよいよ最終日。今出ている\n春香のステージが終わったら、昴たちの出番だ！）", "zh": "（偶夏在今天来到最后一天。\n等现在春香的表演结束，就轮到昴她们上场了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_1001_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "dd9c3f55f1e0e3b5da5fd21b78f4a5e237720b0bfad573272661d57db96a1acb", "ja": "わああああーーーーーっ！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊─────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "ca4fd3432d18926cef17bb8d945b230afff053f920ae1438c962aae9cbb8b73a", "ja": "うわー……お客さん、めちゃくちゃ盛り上がってるよ！\nやっぱ春香って、すげーよな～！", "zh": "哇……观众们兴致高昂耶！\n春香真的好强喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "6a46ab69d4a14f72b080b90a4bcd592e174211f40afde228d6b859be90343b43", "ja": "うぅ……春香さんも、詩花さんも、すごいです……。\nでも、わ、私たちだって……！", "zh": "呜呜……春香和诗花都好厉害……\n不过，我、我们也……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "7c5bd7da71090c37cb1cf2e82bf4c4c9d6b04d88949bb583c9a4cf1f6f2e974d", "ja": "うん！　やろうよ、みんな！　ふたりと同じぐらい……\nううん、もっと盛り上げちゃうつもりでさ！", "zh": "嗯！我们也来吧！像她们两位一样……\n不，我们要把气氛带到更高潮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "949a75daef35606edd158b44b9a3c8bf457194e0e7f2812d96f895861a709ab0", "ja": "はいっ！　私、アイサマで詩花さんだけじゃなくて、\nいろんなアイドルのステージを見て、わかりました。", "zh": "好的！我在这次偶夏期间不只看了诗花，\n还看了其他许多偶像的表演，然后了解到一件事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "9c0f823e99e6f4abb9634f00ff5ca70cf8531a9ae0af87a1a3f25052a045c3f3", "ja": "私たちには、足りないものがたくさんあるんだなって。\nでも、だから、いつかできるようになりたいです！", "zh": "原来我们还有这么多不足的地方。\n但是，也因为这样，我们总有一天要弥补这些不足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "e9cad2bf170ade64688b385d734d7cdb391962ba3e409c89ce2e487a4f3797f4", "ja": "失敗もしたけども、みんなと一緒なら、\n怖くないからねぇ。早くステージに立ちたいべさ！", "zh": "虽然我们犯过错误，但只要大家同心协力，\n就不可怕了呢～好想快点站上舞台哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "d9dbb3a62653e67f9a1e81709b18c929e5d66b28bba066b75cf8380217dd2f6f", "ja": "みんな～！　応援してくれて、ありがとーっ！\n大好きだよ～！", "zh": "大家～！谢谢你们的声援～！\n我最喜欢你们了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_1009_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "2ed46ac51b54365a84b28a3b59751e1267225a63726f2b386d9a0c5481216dfc", "ja": "わああああああああーーーーーっ！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊─────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "eadd4e0a68823083ccbef9dddf4e0fc63454ed6de1a90e77cdea3009437c7687", "ja": "……よし、そろそろ出番だな。さあ、いろいろ気付きの\nあるイベントだったと思うけど、今はとにかく……", "zh": "……好，差不多该上场了。听好了，\n我想各位在这次活动都有许多新发现，但现在只需要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_1014", "source_sha256": "6fcb35015b26c8dd8625dee0e86de1dea3e9abb9485f44b3c42079c6dd0bfbf5", "ja": "楽しんで！", "zh": "尽情享受！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2000_p", "source_sha256": "fbdf2c51a343074ef994cdc440c150f59487bfe12c10bccc3f581cb442b48f82", "ja": "この夏のステージを、思いっきり、楽しんでこい！", "zh": "去尽情享受今天的夏日舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2001_047sub", "source_sha256": "00ca2d5e0af51757823cf4dfed3851cb8d02e9d56a9966eef0f7f0894804278f", "ja": "うんっ♪", "zh": "嗯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2002_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2003_020meg", "source_sha256": "e2effca0771951c1ce7834b09c02089d3423a6451980501a96b804211e896897", "ja": "おっけー♪", "zh": "OK～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2004_035hin", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2005_045kar", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2006_p", "source_sha256": "34ee42e3603720f900d25768d58a8c73460ee5bcbe45b269800c0e5aeb643e66", "ja": "（この様子なら、何の心配もいらなそうだ。\nこのイベント中に、みんな本当に成長したな……！）", "zh": "（看她们这样子，应该不需要我担心了。\n大家真的在这次活动成长了好多……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2007_001har", "source_sha256": "849cbd723858d6c549c712aaace4d9227c498589c727f68803a713ec0070b5c5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです♪\nふぅ～、楽しかった～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了♪\n呼～唱得好开心喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2008_p", "source_sha256": "44f6a5cce99bd9099183afd3487278887445d98b7f5fac0c9cdfdbc299861484", "ja": "おかえり、春香！\n今日一番の盛り上がりだったな。", "zh": "欢迎回来，春香！\n这是今天最热烈的一场表演呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2009_001har", "source_sha256": "45ba3ae508c09b7417b4f3a6be60b8a5c3f250fc3278601ec234849d403ca063", "ja": "あ、あはは、それは言い過ぎだと思いますけど……！\nでも、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "哈、哈哈，我觉得你太过奖了……！\n不过，还是谢谢你的夸奖♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2010_001har", "source_sha256": "aab1158b7f7d34a09bb22c6acf5b094981b3853d771bd7e8917690ac32b62b1d", "ja": "それより、昴ちゃんたち、すっごくいい顔でしたね！\nきっと、すっごく楽しいステージになるんだろうな～♪", "zh": "对了，我看到小昴她们脸上神采奕奕呢！\n我想她们一定能带来很欢乐的演出～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2011_p", "source_sha256": "098eb314c1cd15781a6d7c3eaea54df73879f5f1be0692f1ac394bb25633b1df", "ja": "ああ、そう思うよ。イベントを通じた出会いが、\nいい刺激になったんだろうな。", "zh": "是啊，我也这么想。在这次活动中的邂逅，\n应该有为她们带来不错的刺激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2012_001har", "source_sha256": "cba127edcb284f196c634152ba768d0996dc28ca6109095d4e064eacfbcff791", "ja": "あ、出会いと言えば……恵美ちゃんに聞いたんです\nけど、詩花ちゃん、劇場に遊びに来てくれるんですか？", "zh": "啊，说到邂逅……我有听惠美说了，\n诗花下次要来剧场玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2013_p", "source_sha256": "6acbde71d5a7ba75c0a3e23113dabce8580365cba1c1ab9eed4e39899a8c4b4b", "ja": "ああ、そういうことになりそう……かな？", "zh": "是啊，似乎是这样……应该吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2014_001har", "source_sha256": "151f3a751d0da414fa44f77040f6833cc1907088c4b05c7aa1e896cbadc22d63", "ja": "わぁ、いいですね♪　詩花ちゃんに会ったら、\n他のみんなもきっとビックリするだろうな～。", "zh": "哇～好棒喔♪\n其他人见到诗花，一定会大吃一惊吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2015_001har", "source_sha256": "9d1139396c5a008946dcb50d14d7bd2ecae7207371b2240657fc54f3f03dbb77", "ja": "えへへっ、なんだかますます、\n劇場が賑やかになりそうですね♪　それに……", "zh": "嘿嘿！我们剧场好像变得越来越热闹了♪\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2016_001har", "source_sha256": "eb795ee4b6720bb1f1a58e5ffde029d76d9109071212f9b52e17da15c79cce0c", "ja": "詩花ちゃんも、きっと……\nすっごく、喜んでくれるって思います♪", "zh": "我觉得诗花她一定……\n也会非常开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2017_p", "source_sha256": "80957e4d72278069662ca641d23136435a59e99317536c62bc65319be76dff7a", "ja": "……そうだな。俺もそんな気がするんだ。", "zh": "……对啊，我也这么觉得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2018_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "dd9c3f55f1e0e3b5da5fd21b78f4a5e237720b0bfad573272661d57db96a1acb", "ja": "わああああーーーーーっ！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊─────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2019_p", "source_sha256": "02dbda647a6648303f9ce51ff73d7f09f76b1283c871e132e4a3d6f94e0e1192", "ja": "おっと、昴達のステージが始まるぞ！\n俺達も応援しよう！", "zh": "哎呀，昴她们的表演开始了！\n我们也去声援吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2020_001har", "source_sha256": "907e15454a7660bf685eab9d9e2d685359bdde692ce8a88f84bef55229477cd6", "ja": "はいっ！　みんな、頑張れーっ！", "zh": "好的！大家加油～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2021_047sub", "source_sha256": "4d1049cbf1dfc4a4f5009704223befa9bc59e2dfc3e48958c7b4bab1b6e580ea", "ja": "みんな、聞いてくれよなっ！\nそれじゃ、最初の曲！！　いっくぞ～！", "zh": "大家想听我们唱歌吗！？\n那么，第一首歌！！要开始啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_06_2022_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "2ed46ac51b54365a84b28a3b59751e1267225a63726f2b386d9a0c5481216dfc", "ja": "わああああああああーーーーーっ！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊─────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
